WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.336
School of Computer Science at the gate stop.

2
00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:06.573
Hi, my name is Eric
and I am a student studying

3
00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:09.542
Business Administration here
at Carnegie Mellon University.

4
00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:12.412
One of my favorite things
about the School of Computer Science

5
00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:16.349
is their introductory computer science
class called 15122

6
00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.352
or Fundamentals of Computer Science
and Programing.

7
00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.654
During this class,
you learn the fundamentals of Python

8
00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.523
and complete your homework assignments

9
00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.893
structured as puzzles and games
to solve using coding skills.

10
00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:30.530
At the end of the semester,
I was able to create a video game

11
00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.033
using all the skills
that I learned throughout the semester,

12
00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.701
and I was really proud
of the final product.

13
00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:38.705
Seeing how far I grew from day one,
knowing nothing to the last day,

14
00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:41.741
knowing a whole lot
more than I thought I could ever know.

15
00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:44.911
I had so much fun in this class
that I ended up pursuing a minor

16
00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:48.081
in game design, which I'm currently
finishing up in the next semester.

